# ICNM site — locked decisions

Read `docs/DECISIONS.md` and `docs/CONTEXT.md` before changing scope, IA, or stack. Glossary terms in CONTEXT.md are the project language.

- Official replacement of `ichnm.by` after institute sign-off. Domain does not change.
- Look and IA follow iboch.by; not a pixel clone. Keep ICNM sections: developments, facilities, AIST.
- Staff appear on the lab/department page (short tab + selected publications + metric links). No personal mini-sites for laboratory staff. Official administration pages (director, deputies, honorary director) live under Руководство. Scientific council uses the same card+photo pattern. Labs are self-contained packs at `labs/{slug}/` on this site, not separate domains in v1. Structure dropdown: laboratories, then a visual break, then administrative units (HR, labor protection, chief engineer, accounting).
- v1 language: Russian only. URLs `/`, `/en/`, `/be/`, `/zh/` exist from day one; non-RU are stubs.
- WordPress + Kadence (same constructor as iboch.by). The same staff role publishes news, events, and «СМИ о нас». Do not let editors break header, footer, or vitrine pages.
- Plan a PHP tariff at Active.by or Hoster.by. Do not put WordPress on the current Java Forever stack.
- Homepage: short official intro, mixed news + media-about-us, entries to structure/developments, next event. No 3D promo. Achievements live under About. No separate announcements feed; contact form is in the header.
- Documents: charter, anti-corruption, electronic appeals, requisites (requisites also on Contacts).
- Science, developments, and facilities: photo cards that open a detail page. Cooperation: world map with partner pins.
- Footer: stable NAS pack (president, government, pravo.by, Navuka, profnan.by, NAS portal) + NAS socials + ICNM socials when URLs exist. No empty icons. No seasonal Academy banners.
- AIST is a section on this site; launch may be basic info + stub.
- Cutover: test URL first; old site stays until sign-off. Use institute vector logos at cutover; test may crop from current sites.
- The builder is the institute developer and configurator (hosting, admin, migration). Colleagues still supply source files; there is no second counterpart.
- Visually-impaired mode in v1 (plugin, IBOCH-class).
- Extra IA from IBOCH: union, young scientists council, media-about-us, contact form, footer webmail. Announcements were dropped (2026-08-31).

If a request contradicts `docs/DECISIONS.md`, stop and ask. Product forks from grilling are closed; remaining gaps are files and hosting access.
